# Wedding cards.
#
# Everything before the first "---" is a deck-level default: every card in the
# file inherits it, and can override it.

@art-dir   art
@out-dir   out
@set       WED
@language  EN
@year      2026
@artist    Robert Aldrich
@copyright Robert & Bibbo • 2026

---
# A reusable template. Cards opt in with "@template legend".
@deftemplate legend
@frame  regular
@rarity mythic
@copies 2

---
# ...and one for the non-legendary filler cards.
@deftemplate common
@frame  regular
@rarity common

---
@template legend
@art    IMG_2456.JPEG
@number 001

Sir Whiskers, Snack Thief {2}{G}{W}
Legendary Creature — Cat Noble

Vigilance
When ~ enters the battlefield, create a Food token.
{T}, Sacrifice a Food: Draw a card.
> That was never yours to begin with.
3/4

---
@template common
@art     IMG_2456.JPEG
@art-fit contain
@number  002

Afternoon Sunbeam {1}{W}
Enchantment — Aura

Enchant creature
Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and doesn't untap during its controller's
untap step.
> Some naps are a *commitment*.

---
# No art, no template: bare minimum a card can be.
@number 003
@rarity uncommon

Open Bar {2}{U}
Instant

Draw two cards. You may play an additional land this turn.
